#: kcmlayout.cpp:91
msgid "&Enable keyboard layouts"
msgstr "&ເປີດການໃຊ້ງານຮູບແບບຂອງແປ້ນພິມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Here you can completely disable this module, for example if you use other "
"tools for switching keyboard layouts."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປີດການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ ໄ້ດ້ທີ່ນີ້"
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືອື່ນຯ"
"ໃນການສະລັບແບບຂອງແປ້ນພິມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:107
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "&ລຸ່ນຂອງແປ້ນພິມ:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you don't know what kind of keyboard you have."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລຸ່ນຂອງແປ້ນພິມໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້"
"ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງນີ້ "
"ຂື້ນຢູ່ກັບຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ"
"ຂອງທ່ານ"
"ແລະກ່ງວຂອ້ງກັບລຸ່ນຂອງ "
"\"ຮາດແວຣ\" "
"ແລະຈາກການຜະລິດດ້ວຍ"
"ແປ້ນພິມລຸ້ນໃຫມ່ນັ້ນ"
"ມັກຈະມີປຸ່ມພິເສດສອງປຸ່ມເພື່ອ"
"ເຂົ້າມາ"
"ໂດຍຈັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນລຸ້ນ\"104 "
"ປຸ່ມ\" "
"ໍຊື່ງມັນອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດປັນຫາໄດ້ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ແປ້ນພິມລຸ່ນໃດຢູ່"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:120
msgid "Pr&imary layout:"
msgstr "&ຮູບແບບຫລັກ:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Here you can choose your primary keyboard layout, i.e. the keyboard layout "
"used as default. The keyboard layout defines \"which keys do what\". For "
"example German keyboards have the letter 'Y' where US keyboards have the "
"letter 'Z'."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຮູບແບບຫລັກແປ້ນພິມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າປະລິຍາຍ ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ "
"ນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດໃຫ້ "
"\"ປຸ່ມໃດ ເຮັດຫຍັງ\" "
"ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ"
"ແປ້ນພິມພາສາລາວຈະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນ 'ກ' ຂະນະທີ່ແປ້ນພິມອາເມລິກາຈະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນ 'D' ເປັນຕົ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:133
msgid "Prim&ary variant:"
msgstr "&ປະເພດຫລັກຂອງແປ້ນພິມ:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of your primary keyboard layout. Layout "
"variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For "
"example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in "
"Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter "
"is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Here you can choose a variant of your primary keyboard layout. Layout "
"variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For "
"example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in "
"Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter "
"is placed on a transliterated latin one)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:147
msgid "Additional Layouts"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບເພີ່ມຕື່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:151
msgid ""
"You can select an arbitrary number of additional keyboard layouts. If one or "
"more additional layouts have been selected, the KDE panel will offer a "
"docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຈຳນວນຂອງຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມຕື່ມໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ໍຊື່ງຫາກມີຮູບແບບ ທີ່ຫລາຍກວ່າຫນື່ງແລ້ວລະກະພາ "
"ເນລຂອງ KDE "
"ຈະສະແດງຮູບສົງທີ່ຖາດໄອຄອນຊື່ງທ່ານສາມາດສະລັບຮູບແບບໄດ້ງ່າຍຯ ໂດຍການກົດທີ່ຮູບສົງພາເນລ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:155
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການສະລັບ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:158
msgid "&Global"
msgstr "&ທົ່ວໄປ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:159
msgid "Application"
msgstr "ແອບພິເຄຊັ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:160
msgid "&Window"
msgstr "&ຫນ້າຕ່າງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:173
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "ທຸງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:174
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:175
msgid "Keymap"
msgstr "ຕາລາງປຸ່ມພິມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:186
msgid "&Variant:"
msgstr "&ປະເພດ:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:190
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. "
"Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. "
"For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as "
"in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian "
"letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. "
"Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. "
"For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as "
"in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian "
"letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:207
msgid "&Layout"
msgstr "&ຮູບແບບ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:306
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຂອງ Xkb"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:309
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "&ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫມ່ຕົວເລືອກເດີມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:600
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout & Model</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout "
"and model. The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to "
"your computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and "
"may be different for different countries."
"<p> In addition to the 'Primary Layout', which will be used as the default, "
"you can specify additional layouts, which you can easily switch between "
"using the KDE panel."
msgstr ""
"<h1>ຮູບແບບ ແລະລຸ້ນຂອງແປ້ນພິມ์</h1> "
"ທ່ານສາມາດ ເລືອກຮູບແບບ ແລະລຸ້ນແປ້ນພິມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ 'ລຸ້ນ' "
"ນັ້ນເປັນຊະນິດຂອງແປ້ນພິມທີ່ຕໍ່ຢູ່ກັບເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ນໃນຂະນະທີ່"
"ຮູບແບບຄືສິ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ"
"\"ຄີໃດ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຍັງ\" "
"ແລະຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດ"
"<p> ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະໃຊ້ 'ຮູບແບບຫລັກ' "
"ຊື່ງທ່ານສາມາດ"
"ກຳນົດຮູບແບບເພີ່ມຕື່ມໄດ້"
"ແລະທ່ານສາມາດສະລັບແຕ່ລະເລ"
"ເອາໄດ້ງ່າຍຯ"
"ໂດຍຜ່ານທາງພາເນລຂອງ KDE"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:651
msgid "Group Shift/Lock behavior"
msgstr "ພິດຕິກຳຂອງປຸ່ມໃ Shift/Lock"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:652
msgid "R-Alt switches group while pressed"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Alt "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍໃນການປ່ງນປກຸ່ມຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:653
msgid "Right Alt key changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Alt "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:654
msgid "Caps Lock key changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Caps Lock "
"ໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:655
msgid "Menu key changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Menu "
"ໃນການປງ່ນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:656
msgid "Both Shift keys together change group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Shift "
"ທັ້ງສອງດ້ານໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:657
msgid "Control+Shift changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃໍຊ້ປຸ່ມ Control+Shift "
"ໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:658
msgid "Alt+Control changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Alt+Control "
"ໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:659
msgid "Alt+Shift changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Alt+Shift "
"ໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:660
msgid "Control Key Position"
msgstr "ຕຳແຫນ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມ Control"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:661
msgid "Make Caps Lock an additional Control"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ປຸ່ມ Caps Lock ເປັນປຸ່ມ Control "
"ເພີ່ມຕື່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:662
msgid "Swap Control and Caps Lock"
msgstr "ສະລັບປຸ່ມ Control ແລະປຸ່ມ Caps Lock"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:663
msgid "Control key at left of 'A'"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ Control "
"ຢູຸ່ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງປຸ່ມ 'A'"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:664
msgid "Control key at bottom left"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ Control "
"ຢູ່ທາງດ້າຍຊ້າຍ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:665
msgid "Use keyboard LED to show alternative group"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄຟ LED ຂອງແປ້ນພິມເພື່ອສະແດງກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:666
msgid "Num_Lock LED shows alternative group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໄຟ LED ຂອງ Num_Lock "
"ສະແດງຖືງກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:667
msgid "Caps_Lock LED shows alternative group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໄຟ LED ຂອງ Caps_Lock "
"ສະແດງເຖືງກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:668
msgid "Scroll_Lock LED shows alternative group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໄຟ LED ຂອງ Scroll_Lock "
"ສະແດງເຖິງກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:671
msgid "Left Win-key switches group while pressed"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Win "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍໃນການສະລັບກຸ່ມຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:672
msgid "Right Win-key switches group while pressed"
msgstr ""
"ໃໍຊ້ປຸ່ມ Win "
"ດ້ານຂວາໃນການສະລັບກຸ່ມຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:673
msgid "Both Win-keys switch group while pressed"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Win "
"ທັງສອງດ້ານໃນການສະຫລັບກຸ່ມຂະນະທີ່ຖືກກົດ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:674
msgid "Left Win-key changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Win "
"ດ້ານຊ້າຍໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:675
msgid "Right Win-key changes group"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Win "
"ດ້ານຂວາໃນການປ່ງນກຸ່ມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:676
msgid "Third level choosers"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:677
msgid "Press Right Control to choose 3rd level"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ Control "
"ເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:678
msgid "Press Menu key to choose 3rd level"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ Menu "
"ເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:679
msgid "Press any of Win-keys to choose 3rd level"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ Win "
"ເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:680
msgid "Press Left Win-key to choose 3rd level"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ Win "
"ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:681
msgid "Press Right Win-key to choose 3rd level"
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ Win "
"ທາງດ້ານຂວາເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບທີ່ສາມ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:682
msgid "CapsLock key behavior"
msgstr "ພິຕິກຳຂອງປຸ່ມ CapsLock"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:683
msgid "uses internal capitalization. Shift cancels Caps."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການຍົກແປ້ນພາຍໃນໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Shift "
"ເປັນການຍົກເລີກການຍົກແປ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:684
msgid "uses internal capitalization. Shift doesn't cancel Cap$"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການຍົກແປ້ນພາຍໃນໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Shift "
"ບໍ່ຍົກເລີກການຍົກແປ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:685
msgid "acts as Shift with locking. Shift cancels Caps."
msgstr ""
"ຄືການຍົກແປ້ນພ້ອມກັບລອກໄວ້ ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Shift "
"ເປັນການຍົກເລີກການຍົກແປ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:686
msgid "acts as Shift with locking. Shift doesn't cancel Caps."
msgstr ""
"ຄືການຍົກແປ້ນພ້ອມກັບລອກໄວ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Shift "
"ບໍ່ຍົກເລີກການຍົກແປ້ນ"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:687
msgid "Alt/Win key behavior"
msgstr "ພິຕິກຳຂອງປຸ່ມ Alt/Win"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:688
msgid "Add the standard behavior to Menu key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພິດຕິກຳມາດຕະຖານໃຫ້ກັບປຸ່ມ Menu"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:689
msgid "Alt and Meta on the Alt keys (default)."
